---
// Navbar.astro
---

<header class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.85)] backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.3)] shadow-[0_1px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]">
